# Background: Combat Mode
## File: bg-combat.jpg

**Purpose**: Background for combat encounters
**Dimensions**: 1920x1080 pixels
**Format**: JPG or PNG

## Description
Intense battle scene:
- Dark dungeon or battlefield
- Dramatic lighting
- Sense of danger/tension
- Grid/tactical view friendly

## Color Palette
- Primary: #1a0a0a (dark red-black)
- Secondary: #2d1b1b (blood red)
- Accent: #ff3333 (bright red)
- Highlight: #ff6666 (glowing red)

## Notes
- More saturated than peaceful backgrounds
- High contrast for turn indicators
- Avoid patterns that clash with grid overlay

